{"seq":42,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28210"},"reason":"New fact: Which handset, sold from August 1994 through BellSouth with a touch screen, e-mail, a calendar and fax, is regarded as the first smartphone? — IBM Simon. Added to expand a rich topic; the body now states it.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IBM_Simon"},{"url":"https://gigazine.net/gsc_news/en/20110503_first_touch_panel_smartphone_ibm_simon"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"IBM Simon"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"IBM Simon"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"IBM Simon"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[1585,9],"de":[1656,9],"ru":[1755,9]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"event","start":"1994-08-16","end":null,"precision":"day","approx":false,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"The IBM Simon, the first smartphone, goes on sale","labelDe":"Der IBM Simon, das erste Smartphone, kommt auf den Markt","labelRu":"В продажу поступает IBM Simon — первый смартфон"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IBM_Simon","title":"IBM Simon – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"69318a74bf92"},
